# Records assets/demo.gif. Run with: make gif  (needs charmbracelet/vhs)
Output assets/demo.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1000
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
# Match the animation's 12 fps so the GIF stays small (target < 5 MB).
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "skycast --demo"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

# Step through all 11 scenes with → (manual steps pause auto-advance).
Sleep 3s
Right
Sleep 3s
Right
Sleep 3s
Right
Sleep 3s
Right
Sleep 3s
Right
Sleep 3s
Right
Sleep 3.5s
Right
Sleep 3s
Right
Sleep 3.5s
Right
# Storm and hail stay longer so a lightning strike gets on camera.
Sleep 4.5s
Right
Sleep 4.5s
Type "q"
